[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Making a Bookcase]
[00:00.66]Lesson 37 | 第37课
[00:02.66]Making a bookcase | 制作一个书架
[00:05.58]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.36]What is Susan's favourite colour? | 苏珊最喜欢的颜色是什么？
[00:17.14]You're working hard, George. | 你工作得很努力啊，乔治。
[00:20.34]What are you doing? | 你在做什么？
[00:22.66]I'm making a bookcase. | 我正在做一个书架。
[00:26.37]Give me that hammer please, Dan. | 丹，请把那个锤子给我。
[00:30.22]Which hammer? | 哪个锤子？
[00:32.22]This one? | 这个吗？
[00:33.70]No, not that one. | 不，不是那个。
[00:36.38]The big one. | 那个大的。
[00:38.62]Here you are. | 给你。
[00:40.39]Thanks, Dan. | 谢谢，丹。
[00:42.79]What are you going to do now, George? | 乔治，你现在要做什么？
[00:47.46]I'm going to paint it. | 我要把它漆一下。
[00:50.61]What colour are you going to paint it? | 你打算把它漆成什么颜色？
[00:54.93]I'm going to paint it pink. | 我要把它漆成粉红色。
[00:58.52]Pink! | 粉红色！
[01:00.38]This bookcase isn't for me. | 这个书架不是给我的。
[01:03.68]It's for my daughter, Susan. | 是给我女儿苏珊的。
[01:06.76]Pink's her favourite colour. | 粉红色是她最喜欢的颜色。